    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/297d7a14ff403137f9118acbe1273148.poster.avif?t=1740000715\" width=368 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/297d7a14ff403137f9118acbe1273148.webm?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/297d7a14ff403137f9118acbe1273148.mp4?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Tyrone Watermelon is dead. Killed by his own hubris.<br>You are to take his place.<br>In this absolutely RIVETING sequel to Five Nights at Roner's, you are tasked once again with ensuring the safety of the haunted house you are assigned to. Manage your power, ensure safe function of components, upgrade your systems, and make it out alive. Repeat 5 times, and the paycheck is yours.<br>But, of course, there's a catch...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/da8e3cb268f4a2e77a2e8064a1cadfb8.poster.avif?t=1740000715\" width=368 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/da8e3cb268f4a2e77a2e8064a1cadfb8.webm?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/da8e3cb268f4a2e77a2e8064a1cadfb8.mp4?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Monitor the ghosts and maintain your systems with your handy dandy GooberOS security system!<br>With only one flimsy wooden door, you'll have to make do. You're lucky there's a bed to hide under...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/b5340f7def3a7e2019b7aebb146317ac.poster.avif?t=1740000715\" width=368 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/b5340f7def3a7e2019b7aebb146317ac.webm?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/b5340f7def3a7e2019b7aebb146317ac.mp4?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The clock is your greatest friend, and worst enemy. Hold out as long as you can, and hope the time expires before you do...<br><br>Can you survive, for the second time...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIVE</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NIGHTS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AT</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RONER'S?</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/297d7a14ff403137f9118acbe1273148.poster.avif?t=1740000715\" width=368 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/297d7a14ff403137f9118acbe1273148.webm?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/297d7a14ff403137f9118acbe1273148.mp4?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Tyrone Watermelon is dead. Killed by his own hubris.<br>You are to take his place.<br>In this absolutely RIVETING sequel to Five Nights at Roner's, you are tasked once again with ensuring the safety of the haunted house you are assigned to. Manage your power, ensure safe function of components, upgrade your systems, and make it out alive. Repeat 5 times, and the paycheck is yours.<br>But, of course, there's a catch...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/da8e3cb268f4a2e77a2e8064a1cadfb8.poster.avif?t=1740000715\" width=368 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/da8e3cb268f4a2e77a2e8064a1cadfb8.webm?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/da8e3cb268f4a2e77a2e8064a1cadfb8.mp4?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Monitor the ghosts and maintain your systems with your handy dandy GooberOS security system!<br>With only one flimsy wooden door, you'll have to make do. You're lucky there's a bed to hide under...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/b5340f7def3a7e2019b7aebb146317ac.poster.avif?t=1740000715\" width=368 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/b5340f7def3a7e2019b7aebb146317ac.webm?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972810/extras/b5340f7def3a7e2019b7aebb146317ac.mp4?t=1740000715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The clock is your greatest friend, and worst enemy. Hold out as long as you can, and hope the time expires before you do...<br><br>Can you survive, for the second time...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIVE</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NIGHTS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AT</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RONER'S?</h2>",
